      "file": "features/files/components/surfaces/FileShareTab.tsx",
      "justification": "Describes the 'personal' visibility OPTION in the share picker, and the Info tab beside it shows the true summary via AccessSummaryPanel. Wording still worth softening in the D106b sweep.",
