      "file": "features/flashcards/components/sharing/SetVisibilityControl.tsx",
      "justification": "Describes the 'personal' option in a visibility picker \u2014 a statement about the SETTING being chosen, which is the sanctioned form. Soften wording opportunistically.",
      "date": "2026-08-08"
    },
